<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: CZECH CNB-120 INDEX FALLS 0.5 POINTS TO 757.3 PTS.</title>
<headline>CZECH CNB-120 INDEX FALLS 0.5 POINTS TO 757.3 PTS.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The CNB-120 index, a broad daily measure of Czech equities, fell 0.5 points, or 0.07 percent, on Wednesday to 757.3, the Czech National Bank (CNB) said.</p>
<p>Eight of the ten sectoral indices lost, with the trade index losing the most, down 4.5 points, or 1.79 percent, to 247.1 points.</p>
<p>-- Prague Newsroom, 420-2-2423-0003</p>
